<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82450" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιφέρ-εια</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιφερ-είη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>circumference</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					103
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>(rounded) surface</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαίρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ti.Locr.
					100e
				</span></i>
			 ; of helmets, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				40
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὦτα ἐπὶ τῆς αὐτῆς π. τοῖς
					ὄμμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					494b14
				</span></i>
			; more generally, <i>curve</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1102a31
			</span></i>; <i>curvature</i> of the edge of a leaf, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.10.5
			</span></i> ; <i>roundness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				61
			</span></i> ; <i>spherical</i> or <i>curved shape</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2pp.49,51
			</span></i>U. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>arc of a circle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				264b25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euc.
				3.28
			</span></i>; marked on concave sun-dial (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				358.1
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wandering, error</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν καρδίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ec.</u>
					9.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
